    *> ========================================================
    *> TRANSACTION 1: DEDUCE tariff_applicability_none
    *> Source line: 59-86
    *> RETRIEVAL_BUDGET: NONE → no BERT call, pure reasoning
    *> ========================================================
    TRANSACTION deduce-tariff-none.
        PARALLEL-GROUP      group-1.
        OPERATION           DEDUCE.
        STYLE               INTELLIGENTLY.
        DEPTH               STANDARD.
        RETRIEVAL           NONE.
        CONTRACT            deduce-tariff-none.

        INPUTS.
            PREMISES        premise-1, premise-2, premise-3,
                            premise-4, premise-5.
            APPLY-TO        case-facts.
        END-INPUTS.

        DISPATCH.
            *> Step 1: RETRIEVAL_BUDGET: NONE → skip BERT entirely
            *> No vector search. No terminology lookup.
            SKIP RETRIEVAL-PHASE
                REASON "RETRIEVAL_BUDGET: NONE".

            *> Step 2: Compose the prompt
            USING ROUTING-TABLE reasoning-routes ENTRY DEDUCE.
            USING BUDGET-TABLE retrieval-budgets ENTRY NONE.
            USING DEPTH-TABLE depth-levels ENTRY STANDARD.
            USING STYLE-TABLE style-modifiers ENTRY INTELLIGENTLY.

            COMPOSE-PROMPT FROM:
                TEMPLATE    "deduce-logical"
                REPLACING   {RETRIEVAL_MODIFIER}
                    WITH    BUDGET-TABLE.NONE.PROMPT-MODIFIER
                REPLACING   {DEPTH_SUFFIX}
                    WITH    DEPTH-TABLE.STANDARD.PROMPT-SUFFIX
                REPLACING   {BOUNDARY_INSTRUCTIONS}
                    WITH    "You MUST include analysis of:
                             - Section 232 applicability
                             - USMCA qualification analysis
                             - Anti-dumping margin analysis
                             - CVD subsidy analysis
                             - Final tariff determination
                             Each of the 5 premises must be
                             individually evaluated.
                             You MUST NOT include knowledge not
                             in the premises or external regulatory
                             details.
                             Respond in JSON matching this schema:
                             {OUTPUT_SCHEMA}"
                REPLACING   {FORMATTED_INPUTS}
                    WITH    FORMAT-AS-TEXT(INPUTS)
                REPLACING   {OUTPUT_SCHEMA}
                    WITH    CONTRACT.OUTPUT-FORMAT-SECTION.SCHEMA
            END-COMPOSE.

            *> Step 3: Send to Sonnet
            SEND TO GENERATIVE-STANDARD WITH:
                SYSTEM-PROMPT   COMPOSED-PROMPT.
                USER-MESSAGE    "Analyze whether tariffs apply to
                                 this shipment based ONLY on the
                                 premises and case facts provided.".
                TEMPERATURE     0.2.
                MAX-TOKENS      1536.
        END-DISPATCH.

        ON-RESPONSE.
