            PERFORM RETRIEVAL-PHASE.
                EXTRACT-TERMS FROM INPUTS
                    USING BERT-CLASS MODEL "colbert-v2"
                    DOMAIN "international-trade-law"
                    INTO extracted-terms.

                SEARCH VECTOR-DB
                    INDEX "regulatory-knowledge-full"
