                        reference this knowledge to enrich
                        your analysis)".
            END-RETRIEVAL-PHASE.

            *> Step 2: Compose the prompt (with full knowledge)
            USING ROUTING-TABLE reasoning-routes ENTRY DEDUCE.
            USING BUDGET-TABLE retrieval-budgets ENTRY STANDARD.
            USING DEPTH-TABLE depth-levels ENTRY STANDARD.
            USING STYLE-TABLE style-modifiers ENTRY INTELLIGENTLY.

            COMPOSE-PROMPT FROM:
